  "notes": "A technical term used primarily for machines, devices, and mechanisms. The focus is on whether the device is functioning rather than on the act of operating it.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {正常|せいじょう}に{作動|さどう}する (operate normally)\n- {作動|さどう}{確認|かくにん} (operation check)\n- {作動|さどう}{温度|おんど} (operating temperature)\n- {作動|さどう}{条件|じょうけん} (operating conditions)\n- {誤|ご}{作動|さどう} (malfunction, false activation)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {作動|さどう}: operation/functioning of a machine (whether it works)\n- {操作|そうさ}: operation/manipulation (the act of using or controlling)\n- {動作|どうさ}: action, movement (of a person or machine)\n- {稼働|かどう}: operation, running (of a factory or system — emphasizes being in service)",
